# Bayonets
ent-WH40KWeaponModBayonetCantrael = M36 Cantrael bayonet
    .desc = Mounts on the M36 Cantrael and replaces the buttstock strike with a bayonet thrust.
ent-WH40KWeaponModBayonetCombatShotgun = Combat shotgun bayonet
    .desc = A stabbing bayonet for the combat shotgun. Replaces the stock bash with a hard thrust in melee.
ent-WH40KWeaponModBayonetVoss = M8 Voss bayonet
    .desc = Mounts on the M8 Voss and replaces the buttstock strike with a bayonet thrust.
ent-WH40KWeaponModBayonetKrieg = Lucius-pattern lasgun bayonet
    .desc = Mounts on the lucius-pattern lasgun and replaces the buttstock strike with a bayonet thrust.
ent-WH40KWeaponModBayonetAccatran = Accatran VI D bayonet
    .desc = Mounts on the Accatran VI D and replaces the buttstock strike with a bayonet thrust.
ent-WH40KWeaponModBayonetStubRifle = Agripinaa Mk.III bayonet
    .desc = Mounts on the Agripinaa Mk.III assault rifle and replaces the buttstock strike with a bayonet thrust.
ent-WH40KWeaponModBayonetStubShotgun = M18 "Fizzo" bayonet
    .desc = Mounts on the M18 "Fizzo" and replaces the buttstock strike with a bayonet thrust.
ent-WH40KWeaponModBayonetStubSMG2 = Stub-machine gun bayonet
    .desc = Mounts on the stub-machine gun and replaces the buttstock strike with a bayonet thrust.
ent-WH40KWeaponModSerpStubSMG2 = Stub-machine gun serp
    .desc = A slashing serp blade for the stub-machine gun. Replaces the buttstock strike with a sweeping slash.
ent-WH40KWeaponModBayonetStubSMG3 = "Sprinkler" bayonet
    .desc = Mounts on the "Sprinkler" and replaces the buttstock strike with a bayonet thrust.
ent-WH40KWeaponModSerpStubSMG3 = "Sprinkler" serp
    .desc = A slashing serp blade for the "Sprinkler". Replaces the buttstock strike with a sweeping slash.

# Stocks
ent-WH40KWeaponModStockCantrael = M36 Cantrael stock
    .desc = A full stock for the M36 Cantrael. While the lasgun is wielded, it steadies the weapon at the cost of speed.
ent-WH40KWeaponModFoldingStockCantrael = M36 Cantrael folding stock
    .desc = A folding stock for the M36 Cantrael. Deploy it for better recoil control, or fold it to remove the speed penalty.
ent-WH40KWeaponModStockCombatShotgun = Combat shotgun stock
    .desc = A solid stock for the combat shotgun. While the weapon is wielded, it trades movement speed for tighter spread and lighter recoil.
ent-WH40KWeaponModStockVoss = M8 Voss stock
    .desc = A full stock for the M8 Voss. While the lasgun is wielded, it steadies the weapon at the cost of speed.
ent-WH40KWeaponModFoldingStockVoss = M8 Voss folding stock
    .desc = A folding stock for the M8 Voss. Deploy it for better recoil control, or fold it to remove the speed penalty.
ent-WH40KWeaponModStockStubRifle = Agripinaa Mk.III stock
    .desc = A full stock for the Agripinaa Mk.III assault rifle. While the weapon is wielded, it steadies the weapon at the cost of speed.
ent-WH40KWeaponModFoldingStockStubRifle = Agripinaa Mk.III folding stock
    .desc = A folding stock for the Agripinaa Mk.III assault rifle. Deploy it for better recoil control, or fold it to remove the speed penalty.
ent-WH40KWeaponModStockStubShotgun = M18 "Fizzo" stock
    .desc = A full stock for the M18 "Fizzo". While the weapon is wielded, it steadies the weapon at the cost of speed.

