# Barrels
ent-WH40KWeaponModLongBarrelCantrael = M36 Cantrael extended barrel
    .desc = A long barrel for the M36 Cantrael. Increases projectile speed, tightens spread and softens recoil, at the cost of slight mobility while wielded.
ent-WH40KWeaponModLongBarrelAccatran = Accatran VI D extended barrel
    .desc = A long barrel for the Accatran VI D. Increases projectile speed, tightens spread and softens recoil, at the cost of slight mobility while wielded.
ent-WH40KWeaponModLongBarrelKrieg = Lucius-pattern lasgun extended barrel
    .desc = A long barrel for the lucius-pattern lasgun. Increases projectile speed, tightens spread and softens recoil, at the cost of slight mobility while wielded.

# Short barrels
ent-WH40KWeaponModShortBarrelCantrael = M36 Cantrael short barrel
    .desc = A sawn-off barrel for the M36 Cantrael. Slightly speeds the wielder up, but the bullet flies slower and spread and recoil grow.
ent-WH40KWeaponModShortBarrelAccatran = Accatran VI D short barrel
    .desc = A sawn-off barrel for the Accatran VI D. Slightly speeds the wielder up, but the bullet flies slower and spread and recoil grow.
ent-WH40KWeaponModShortBarrelKrieg = Lucius-pattern lasgun short barrel
    .desc = A sawn-off barrel for the lucius-pattern lasgun. Slightly speeds the wielder up, but the bullet flies slower and spread and recoil grow.

# Grenade launchers
ent-WH40KWeaponModGrenadeLauncherCantrael = M36 Cantrael underbarrel grenade launcher
    .desc = An underslung single-shot launcher for the M36 Cantrael. Loads one grenade and lets the wielder switch to grenade fire on demand.
ent-WH40KWeaponModGrenadeLauncherAccatran = Accatran VI D underbarrel grenade launcher
    .desc = An underslung single-shot launcher for the Accatran VI D. Loads one grenade and lets the wielder switch to grenade fire on demand.

# Foregrips
ent-WH40KWeaponModForegripAccatran = Accatran VI D foregrip
    .desc = An underbarrel foregrip for the Accatran VI D. While the weapon is wielded, it steadies the rifle and trims spread growth.
ent-WH40KWeaponModForegripStubRifle = Agripinaa Mk.III foregrip
    .desc = An underbarrel foregrip for the Agripinaa Mk.III assault rifle. While the weapon is wielded, it steadies the rifle and trims spread growth.
ent-WH40KWeaponModForegripStubSMG2 = Stub-machine gun foregrip
    .desc = An underbarrel foregrip for the stub-machine gun. While the weapon is wielded, it steadies the weapon and trims spread growth.
ent-WH40KWeaponModForegripStubSMG3 = "Sprinkler" foregrip
    .desc = An underbarrel foregrip for the "Sprinkler". While the weapon is wielded, it steadies the weapon and trims spread growth.

# Bipods
ent-WH40KWeaponModBipodAccatran = Accatran VI D bipod
    .desc = A folding bipod for the Accatran VI D. When wielded and prone, it zeroes out spread and recoil at the cost of mobility.

# Slings
ent-WH40KWeaponModSlingCombatShotgun = Combat shotgun sling
    .desc = A carrying sling for the combat shotgun. Lets you carry it on your back or belt even without armor storage. While the weapon is held, the sling keeps it from dropping on fall, stun, or critical condition.
ent-WH40KWeaponModSlingKrieg = Lucius-pattern lasgun sling
    .desc = A carrying sling for the lucius-pattern lasgun. Lets you carry it on your back or belt even without armor storage. While the weapon is held, the sling keeps it from dropping on fall, stun, or critical condition.
ent-WH40KWeaponModSlingStubShotgun = M18 "Fizzo" sling
    .desc = A carrying sling for the M18 "Fizzo". Lets you carry it on your back or belt even without armor storage. While the weapon is held, the sling keeps it from dropping on fall, stun, or critical condition.

